Pull a bolt of temporal energy back through time.  The bolt will home in on your location, dealing [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage to targets, and reducing the cooldown of one chronomancy talent on cooldown by one turn per enemy hit.

The bolt gains 5% damage each time it moves and the damage will scale with your Spellpower.

At talent level five cooldowns are reduced by two.
